<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept importance="optional" id="t00144">
	<title>Rest Mode</title>
	<shortdesc/>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e00696">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="53*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="47*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig id="e00697">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25Z097_E.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Rest Mode in the infotainment system set vehicle to a state optimized for relaxation.</p>
		<section id="e00698">
			<title>Simple operation</title>
			<ul id="e00699">
				<li>
					<p>Select the <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Rest Mode</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system to set Rest Mode.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section id="e00700">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ul id="e00701">
				<li>
					<p>Select the <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Rest Mode</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Using this feature works as follows:</p>
					<ul id="e00702">
						<li>
							<p>All displays turn off</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Ambient lights turn off</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>The outside (fresh) air position turns on</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Change to a temperature optimized for rest</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>The selected seat (driver’s seat/passenger’s seat) will swith to relaxation comfort seat</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section id="e00703">
			<title>Operation condition(s)</title>
			<p>The vehicle is on Utility mode</p>
			<note type="caution" id="e00704">
				<p>Make sure there is enough space in the rear seat before using rest mode.</p>
			</note>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>